## Security Lessons

- Centralize and retain cloud audit logs according to policy.
- Enable integrity validation and encryption for log storage.
- Monitor GuardDuty findings and route them to the appropriate response workflow.
- Prioritize vulnerabilities based on severity, exploitability, and network exposure.
- Use Detective to add context and relationships to security findings.
- Verify the active account, Region, and IAM permissions before running AWS CLI commands.
- Replace lab-specific bucket names, ARNs, and IDs with values from your own authorized environment.
